---
import "@fontsource/fragment-mono";
import "../styles/global.scss";
import "../styles/sidebar.scss";
import { ClientRouter } from "astro:transitions";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/banana_favicon.png" />
    <meta name="description" content="Links to corners of the web" />
    <title>Links</title>
    <ClientRouter />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="sidebar-container">
      <span class="name">
        <a class="name-link" href="/">Adarsh</a>
      </span>
      <div style={{ maxWidth: "350px" }}>
        I reside in many corners of the web. I collect things on ✶✶{" "}
        <a class="wavy-link" href="https://www.cosmos.so/adarzh" target="_blank"
          >Cosmos</a
        >
        . I always have my hands full with (side) projects, which I publish on 💻{
          " "
        }
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://github.com/adarzh-sys"
          target="_blank">GitHub</a
        >{" "}
        wherever possible. You can view a nice version of my resume on 📃{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250122020808/read.cv/adarzh"
          target="_blank"
        >
          Read.cv
        </a>
        . For the no-funny-business side of things, see my 💼{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/adarzh"
          target="_blank">LinkedIn</a
        >
        . I try to read as much as I can, and update my reading lists on 📚{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/47941642-adarzh"
          target="_blank"
        >
          Goodreads
        </a>
        . I have an 📸{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://www.instagram.com/teaesthete"
          target="_blank">Instagram</a
        >
        , but I'm not active on there. I'm not a big movie person but I've been watching
        more of them, and was persuaded to make a 🍿{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://letterboxd.com/adarzh/"
          target="_blank">Letterboxd</a
        >
        , so I have that too. Though, most times, I'm on 🐦{" "}
        <a
          class="wavy-link"
          href="https://twitter.com/teaesthete"
          target="_blank">Twitter</a
        >
        . Phew.
      </div>

      <div style={{ paddingBottom: "55px" }}>
        <a href="/">← Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
